{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>physionomist</strong> in a fractured society undergoing multiple crises. Face the dangers of nightlife, take on increasingly risky contracts, build a solid reputation with clubs, and buy equipment to secure a better future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/4d5788c55cd34303ee90b2dc70bc78ff.poster.avif?t=1771793826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/4d5788c55cd34303ee90b2dc70bc78ff.webm?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/4d5788c55cd34303ee90b2dc70bc78ff.mp4?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who gets in the club and who doesn't. Analyse customers to find out if they are sober, unarmed and of legal age. See if they have suspicious white marks on their nose which can prove drug use, or if they have a specific tattoo on their body. Talk to them to validate your assumptions and reject them if they are confirmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/564075513b23d38f47861a78a880c1b2.poster.avif?t=1771793826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/564075513b23d38f47861a78a880c1b2.webm?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/564075513b23d38f47861a78a880c1b2.mp4?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful what you say to people. They react dynamically to your actions and remember your interactions. It's not uncommon to see fights break out because of a misunderstanding or a clumsy remark. Watch your back if you've denied access to someone with a grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Order</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/064a2a9a40cda58e41f10c14525cedab.poster.avif?t=1771793826\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/064a2a9a40cda58e41f10c14525cedab.webm?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/064a2a9a40cda58e41f10c14525cedab.mp4?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For everyone to enjoy a great night at the club, following the rules is a must. Otherwise, the police could shut down the place, or worse. Don\u2019t hesitate to remind others to respect them, and if they refuse, ensure compliance by <strong>any means necessary</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/67402ededbf6dd7ecfa418e746b3c41f.poster.avif?t=1771793826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/67402ededbf6dd7ecfa418e746b3c41f.webm?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/67402ededbf6dd7ecfa418e746b3c41f.mp4?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes diplomacy is no longer a viable option in your work. You will have to use force to solve problems. That said, be careful of collateral damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Savings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/798d9fb5628801dddd90ddfd88769329.poster.avif?t=1771793826\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/798d9fb5628801dddd90ddfd88769329.webm?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/extras/798d9fb5628801dddd90ddfd88769329.mp4?t=1771793826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each mission, you'll have to choose wisely which expenses to cover such as the rent, heating, groceries, ... Try to put as much money aside as possible to cover unexpected events, and to buy some useful stuff in the market such as a gym membership to be stronger, or a melee weapon to defend yourself more effectively. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953270?t=1771793826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953270?t=1771793826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/6546ddb4c71abab295b0a76c1010a1150defbada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771793826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953270/6546ddb4c71abab295b0a76c1010a1150defbada/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771793826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":